  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Local self Gvmt, 3</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lokalt sj&#xe4;lvstyre, fas 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim is to strengthen the democracy in Ukraine by genereting positive attitudes towards the Law of the Irpin experiment (Kiev)among members of the parliament(through study-visits), and to improve the efficiency of municipal services by creating proposals for modern operative system for local self-government (study-visits)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utveckling av kommunalt sj&#xe4;lvstyre, fas III. Det grundl&#xe4;ggande syftet &#xe4;r en f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning av demokratin i Ukraina; generera mer positiva attityder vg lagf&#xf6;rslagen i Irpin-experimentet hos parlaments- ledam&#xf6;ter, och &#xe4;ven att utveckla f&#xf6;rslag till mer effektiva operativa system f&#xf6;r lokalt sj&#xe4;lvstyre. Detta sker fr&#xe4;mst genom studiebes&#xf6;k.</narrative>
  </description>
